Package: ti-mesa-pvr
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libglvnd0, libegl1, libgles2, ti-sgx-26.1-j721e-ddx-um
Recommends: ti-sgx-26.1-j721e-dkms
Description: Mesa 25.2.8 with TI PowerVR (pvr) driver, installed in /opt
 TI's Mesa fork (powervr/25.2.8, commit 7b6e8de) built with the gallium
 "pvr" driver, the PowerVR Vulkan WSI helper and GBM, providing hardware
 OpenGL ES 3.2 on TI PowerVR Rogue GPUs (e.g. GE8430 on the BeagleBone
 AI-64) through the TI DDK user-space libraries.
 .
 Built with gallium-pvr-alias=tidss so EGL/GBM on the tidss display device
 renders on the GPU. Installed under /opt/ti-mesa-25.2.8 so it does not
 replace Debian's Mesa; run programs on it with "ti-mesa-run <program>".
 Desktop OpenGL is not provided by the DDK (falls back to softpipe).
